Icons
-----
The SVG files under
  htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/dashboard/icons/sd-*.svg
are taken from the project LianXia233/luci-app-mt5700
(https://github.com/LianXia233/luci-app-mt5700), directory
  htdocs/luci-static/resources/at-webserver/icons/normal/
and renamed with an "sd-" prefix so they never collide with the icons shipped
by luci-mod-dashboard.

Upstream license: GPL-3.0. They are included here at the project owner's
explicit request, purely as static UI assets (no upstream code is used).

